Z||000000||87FieroGTx||10-10-2001||04:02 AM|||| I had just picked my girlfriend up from work and was taking her home, we were almost there on a loose dirt road when a Ratcoon ran out in front uf us so she reaches over and jerks the wheel!!!! The car starts to fishtail "I wasnt worried I race AutoX and have goten out of worse (on pavement)" But the Dirt Road didn't like my Fiero/ME every time I tried to correct it just got worse intill I took a trip into a Corn field(<P> The car is 97%<P> My GF is 100%<P> I'm 100%<P> Ratcoon is 0%<P> My question is, was it just me or does the Fiero handle weird on dirt?<P><BR>PS..  I yelled at her for an hour for jerking the wheel!!!!!||||reg||1
