Z||000019||mrfixit58||10-12-2001||05:23 PM||||It wasn't the dirt road... it was the raccoon! Them thangs is slippery little devils.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Seriously, never jump off the throttle on water, ice, snow, dirt, etc. Always ease out of the throttle. All you want is enough drag on the rear wheels to keep them from sliding but enough to keep the rear of the car facing the rear. Easier said than done when someone ELSE grabs the wheel!<BR><P>------------------<BR>Roy  :D <BR>Just another stock Blue 87 GT   <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pennocksize.JPG">      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif"> ||||reg||4
